// Package-level codegen directive for the wire contract.
//
// The stubs used to be regenerated by a protoc command copied out of the README, with
// nothing checking the result matched the .proto. That is how a copy of this contract in
// the CLI scaffold drifted a month behind and lost a field entirely — nobody noticed
// because nothing looked. `go generate ./contracts/...` plus the diff check in
// _scripts/verify.sh makes drift a build failure instead of a discovery.
//
// Requires protoc plus the two plugins at the versions the current stubs were built with:
//
//	go install google.golang.org/protobuf/cmd/protoc-gen-go@v1.36.11
//	go install google.golang.org/grpc/cmd/protoc-gen-go-grpc@v1.6.2
package contracts

//go:generate protoc --go_out=.. --go_opt=paths=source_relative --go-grpc_out=.. --go-grpc_opt=paths=source_relative modulerpc/v1/modulerpc.proto
